        "value": "FRAM Drive™cabin air filters prevent harmful airborne particles from entering your vehicle’s cabin. It is engineered to filter the air before it gets to you, removing dust, pollen, and other pollutants. Replacing a dirty cabin air filter with a new FRAM Drive cabin air filter can optimize clean air flow and maintain peak HVAC system performance. FRAM recommends changing your cabin air filter every 12 months.",
